# AUTONOMOUS OPS PAUSED — 2026-06-06

Autonomous cron sessions are PAUSED. `scripts/run_autonomous_session.sh` and
`scripts/START.sh` both check for this file at the repo root and exit
immediately while it exists.

## Why

Stale WSL cron entries (installed weeks ago via `scripts/setup_wsl_cron.sh`)
kept firing 2-hourly sessions after they were supposed to be retired. Between
2026-05-28 and 2026-06-01 they re-inflated the bike catalog to 799 phantom
rows (fixed + made idempotent in commit `7e2b82a`) and pushed ~14 deploys/day
to Render. Paused until the operator deliberately re-enables.

## To re-enable autonomous ops

1. Verify the cron state in WSL first:
       crontab -l
   Remove unwanted entries with `bash scripts/setup_wsl_cron.sh --uninstall`
   (or `crontab -e` by hand).
2. Delete this file:  rm AUTONOMOUS_PAUSED
3. Re-install the schedule you actually want:
       bash scripts/setup_wsl_cron.sh --every-hours N

